    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/baae0e0df24f7bfae35ad2248a4d3fd3.poster.avif?t=1752459693\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/baae0e0df24f7bfae35ad2248a4d3fd3.webp?t=1752459693\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=296 /></picture></span><strong>TIME TO UNLEASH THE BEAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Trigger</strong> is a fast-paced 2D platform fighting game where you can choose to play as different beasts, with different abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select various maps to challenge your aim and grappling skills.<br><br>Whether you like a machine gun, rocket launcher, or a laser sniper... You can choose from the current roster of these cute but fierce beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/a66babbf8501a45401ba652a3be3f2b9.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/4d0709b38716cd6cf769928669df3982.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/dfdc2cd336bb1f3debbcf09b731e67ad.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/c0ee44c52343779df6170d42c27d23be.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/b40a85ffec30360062df9330afdbbc6c.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/a0e37b7b0beb5ce8ef3f68e69f986806.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/baae0e0df24f7bfae35ad2248a4d3fd3.poster.avif?t=1752459693\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/baae0e0df24f7bfae35ad2248a4d3fd3.webp?t=1752459693\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=296 /></picture></span><strong>TIME TO UNLEASH THE BEAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Trigger</strong> is a fast-paced 2D platform fighting game where you can choose to play as different beasts, with different abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select various maps to challenge your aim and grappling skills.<br><br>Whether you like a machine gun, rocket launcher, or a laser sniper... You can choose from the current roster of these cute but fierce beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/a66babbf8501a45401ba652a3be3f2b9.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/4d0709b38716cd6cf769928669df3982.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/dfdc2cd336bb1f3debbcf09b731e67ad.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/c0ee44c52343779df6170d42c27d23be.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/b40a85ffec30360062df9330afdbbc6c.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848420/extras/a0e37b7b0beb5ce8ef3f68e69f986806.avif?t=1752459693\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "BEAST TRIGGER is a 2D platform fighting game that lets you compete with other beasts in an arena. Grapple, aim, and shoot your way through to defeat your opponent. Choose different beasts, each with unique skills and different play styles. Time to unleash the beast!",
